  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款益智建筑堡垒积木拼搭套装，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动和创意搭建场景。",
    "en": "This is an educational fort building block set made with PP structural parts, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and creative construction scenarios."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "这是一款益智建筑堡垒积木拼搭套装，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动和创意搭建场景。",
      "该款益智建筑堡垒积木拼搭套装采用模块化拼接结构，可围绕堡垒，帐篷和通道进行多形态搭建，适合儿童持续创意构建。",
      "产品适用于亲子互动，课程教具和活动空间布置，支持动手能力，手眼协调和协作玩法训练。",
      "关键参数包括宽(cm)33.50、拼砌玩具类型拼装积木、材质PP。",
      "包装参数支持体积(cm³)10803.750、包装方式彩盒。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This is an educational fort building block set made with PP structural parts, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities.",
      "This educational fort building block set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts around forts, tents.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, educational props, and event-space setup, helping develop hands-on ability, hand-eye coordination.",
      "Key specs include 3C Category: Other Toys for Under 14; Width (cm): 33.50; Toy: Assembly Building Blocks.",
      "Packaging supports Volume (cm³): 10803.750; Packaging: Color Box."
    ]
  },
